# Build context for the FreeCAD DevBox images.
#
# The image only needs four paths (see the COPY lines in the Dockerfiles):
#   .devcontainer/versions.json
#   .devcontainer/opencode/opencode.json
#   .devcontainer/requirements-freecad-mcp.lock
#   .devcontainer/scripts/runtime/
#
# Everything below is therefore excluded. This is a deny-list on purpose: if a
# new COPY source is ever added to a Dockerfile, add it here too. Otherwise the
# build fails loudly with "not found" instead of silently shipping the tree.
#
# The Dockerfile passed via -f is read directly from disk and does NOT need to be
# in the context, so excluding the debian/ directory is safe.

# --- version control --------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- host-only tooling, never baked into the image -------------------------
# scripts/build/{resolve-versions,update-versions}.sh run on the host; only
# scripts/runtime/ is COPY'd into the image.
.devcontainer/scripts/build/
.devcontainer/debian/
.devcontainer/devcontainer.json
README.md
build.bat
update-pinned-version.sh

# --- Windows working-copy junk ----------------------------------------------
# This repo is edited on a Windows drive, so these appear uninvited.
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk
*.stackdump

# --- editor / OS noise ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- language / build artefacts ---------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.log
*.AppImage